title code-flow — LoanOrder 状态机（取自真实代码）

' LoanStatus 实际取值集合（types.ts）：
'   draft, pending, approved, rejected, active, closed

[*] --> draft
note on link
  POST /orders  (LoanOrderService.save 无 id)
  → store.createOrder(..., status='draft')
  来源：loanOrderService.ts::save
end note

state "draft" as draft
state "pending" as pending
state "approved" as approved
state "rejected" as rejected
state "active" as active
state "closed" as closed

draft --> pending : submit()
note on link
  LoanOrderService.submit(id)
  校验 canTransition(order.status, 'pending')
  store.updateOrder(status='pending')
  store.createLog(action='submit', '提交申请，进入自动审批')
  来源：loanOrderService.ts::submit
end note

pending --> approved : autoApprove() [score >= passThreshold]
note on link
  ScoringRules.autoApprove(orderId)
  decision = 'approved' 时：
  store.updateOrder(status='approved')
  store.createLog(action='approve', decisionReason)
  store.createCredit(approved_amount=order.amount, approved_rate=annualRate)
  来源：scoring.ts::autoApprove
end note

pending --> rejected : autoApprove() [score < passThreshold]
note on link
  ScoringRules.autoApprove(orderId)
  decision = 'rejected' 时：
  store.updateOrder(status='rejected')
  store.createLog(action='approve', decisionReason)
  store.createCredit(approved_amount=0, approved_rate=0)
  来源：scoring.ts::autoApprove
end note

approved --> active : sign()
note on link
  OrderFlowService.sign(id)
  校验 canTransition('approved', 'active')
  store.updateOrder(status='active')
  store.createLog(action='sign', '用户确认签署合同')
  返回 contractDetail
  来源：orderFlowService.ts::sign
end note

active --> closed : complete(comment)
note on link
  OrderFlowService.complete(id, comment)
  校验 canTransition('active', 'closed')
  store.updateOrder(status='closed')
  store.createLog(action='complete', comment || '订单已完成')
  来源：orderFlowService.ts::complete
end note

rejected --> [*]
closed --> [*]

' ----------------------------------------------------------
' 补充说明：submit() 原子性
' ----------------------------------------------------------
note right of pending
  **代码观察：submit() 原子执行 draft→pending→{approved,rejected}**
  在 LoanOrderService.submit 中：
  ① store.updateOrder(status='pending')
  ② const result = autoApprove(id)
  ③ store.updateOrder(status=result.decision)
  三步连续执行，无外部观测到中间 pending 状态的窗口。
  对调用方而言：POST /orders/:id/submit 的结果
  只会是 approved 或 rejected。
  pending 仅作为 OrderLog(action='submit') 的语义记录保留。
end note

' ----------------------------------------------------------
' 合法迁移表（types.ts::STATUS_TRANSITIONS）
' ----------------------------------------------------------

'   **STATUS_TRANSITIONS（types.ts 声明）**
'   draft    → [pending]
'   pending  → [approved, rejected]
'   approved → [active]
'   rejected → []
'   active   → [closed]
'   closed   → []
' 
'   代码中所有状态变更均先经 canTransition 校验：
'   canTransition(from, to) := STATUS_TRANSITIONS[from]?.includes(to) ?? false
'   非法迁移抛错：err.status = 400，message 含 "非法流转"
' end 迁移表注释

@enduml